  "semantics": [
    "Action modes1/2/3 rest below floor(maxHP*60/40/90 /100). Target selection scans X/Y and consumes rand()%count; a movement-phase probe can consume a separate draw before the actual attack.",
    "Native ExecuteSoldierAI clears timer298 to0 on queued20 entry; the inside defense rest decision compares clock()-0 against3000. It is not a newly invented three-second hold after each target.",
    "No-packet native ticks prepare30 at full AP or clear local movement/control bits and hint; authoritative HP/AP/positions/XP/items are not changed by those no-packet ticks.",
    "ResetCharacter zeros100 dwords starting14C, including1FC rest hint. Approved auto action sends then zerosAP60 and clears ready bit10; movement uses explicit server AP outcome.",
    "Actual native x86 planner differential test is independently recorded in native-soldier-ai-check.json. Path presentation queue/empty MFC strings/I/O are hooked; actual original playback is not claimed."
  ]
